@startuml
autonumber
actor "Field Officer" as FO
participant "Mini App" as UI
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "Supabase" as DB
participant "Telegram Bot API" as TgAPI
actor "Manager" as MGR

FO -> UI : Fill form & Photo
UI -> API : POST /api/reports (JSON+Image)
API -> DB : Upload Image to Storage
DB --> API : Return Image URL
API -> DB : INSERT report data & UPDATE target
DB --> API : Success
API --> UI : HTTP 200 OK
UI --> FO : Show "Success"
note right of API : Notification triggered
API -> TgAPI : sendMessage(chat_id, text)
TgAPI --> MGR : 📋 New Report: [Customer] – [Status] by [Officer]
@enduml
